 "notes": [
  "Five lineages, all four stages each, no child death, no rerun, no lineage ended; 22 cells x 24 fresh manifests (3,072 cases per policy); 3,105,435 charged starts of 3,200,000; 422 of 720 minutes; no model calls.",
  "Primary (frozen rule): equal-weight mean JOINT-stage gain over D-072 +0.308, two-level 95% interval [0.247, 0.370] on 4 df: lower bound below 0.30 and upper bound above it, so INCONCLUSIVE on the registered magnitude. The interval excludes zero by a wide margin; every lineage's stage-D endpoint qualifies against D-072 (gains 0.317, 0.315, 0.232, 0.332, 0.346).",
  "Stage means (sd across lineages): A 0.546 (0.010), B 0.651 (0.052), C 0.730 (0.036), D 0.743 (0.044); D-072 0.435; historical JOINT 0.792 on the same cases. All five replicated JOINT endpoints score below the historical asset (differences -0.012 to -0.126; four intervals exclude zero): the historical lineage is the best of six, so 0.79-0.80 overstates what the recipe yields on average.",
  "Stage A replicates tightly; variance enters at stage B (0.576 to 0.712). Stages A, B and C qualify over their parent in all five lineages; the JOINT stage D qualifies over C in only one of five after Holm (steps +0.016, +0.008, -0.002, +0.019, +0.022).",
  "Lineage 2 is the low one (0.667): it kept a long ramp-out (38 steps) and a stroke multiplier near 1, and has 288 intermittent and 182 near-miss failures against 86-131 and 61-98 elsewhere.",
  "Deviations: (1) the smoke used 16,471 starts against an estimated at most 16,400. (2) Implementer bug, no outcome seen: the driver's divergence check rejected lineage 0's stage-A terminal mean because a coefficient clipped at -0.10 is stored as float32 (-0.1000000015); the driver was stopped while lineage 1 stage A was training (that child finished untouched), the tolerance was fixed (1e-6), the wrong state file was kept as lineage_0/endpoints.false_divergence.json, and the driver was relaunched reusing both finished stages unchanged; no seed was rerun. (3) The manifests are named shadowhand_spin_q1_s<seed>.yaml as registered, outside the pen_spin_stage3_* pattern older studies glob for disjointness; this module globs both.",
  "Limits: five lineages (4 df) on one task, simulator and reference; per-case cells and traces stay on the GPU box."
 ]
